"""
 Test for Security Tags appearing in security marked CCDAs
 @owners: dcarlson nrichardson
 @filedeps: system/layouts/WCENCSECTION/Patient Education.html, system/layouts/StructDoc/*.html
"""
@@@Set CCDA on VISIT archive
driver.miedb.dbExec("UPDATE encounter_visit_types SET cda_template='Layout:CCDA' where visit_type='VISIT'")
@@@
Navigate "?f=chart&s=pat&t=Patient+Summary&v=dashboard&pat_id=18"
Click the "Add Visit" link
Open "CCDA Settings" dynamicsection
Select 2nd 'RESTRICTED' radio
Type "Selenium redisclosure text." into the "DEI_CCDA_RestrictedText" input
Screenshot "Restricted Created and closed section"
Click the "Save Incomplete & View" button
Click the "Create Preliminary Archive" link
@Wait 30 seconds@driver.pause(30)
Screenshot "Doc Created"
Click the "Documents" charttab
Click the 1st "CDA Document" link
Verify exists @Lock Icon@xpath='//img[@title="Confidentiality: Restricted"]'
Click the "Properties" link
Click the "CDA Document" link
Verify exists 'confidentialityCode code="R"' text